u, a man or a woman who does evil in the eyes of Hashem, your G-d, by violating his covenant."},{"verse":"3","text":"And he goes and serves other gods, and he bows to them, to the sun or to the moon, or to any of the hosts of the heavens, which I have commanded to not do."},{"verse":"4","text":"When you are told, and you understand, you are to investigate thoroughly; If the accusation is in fact true and accurate, it will be an abomination within Yisrael."},{"verse":"5","text":"And you should take out that man or that woman that did this evil thing, to your city, the man or the woman, and you are to stone them with stones, and they will die."},{"verse":"6","text":"By the testimony of two or three witnesses, we put the guilty to death, [but] by the testimony of one [witness], we do not kill [the guilty]."},{"verse":"7","text":"The hand of the witnesses should be the ones to kill him first, and the hands of the people [should be] the second [to stone him], and you will eradicate the evil from your midst."},{"verse":"8","text":"If a matter of law is beyond your understanding, (for example) between [impure] blood to [pure] blood, between [an innocent] verdict and [a guilty] verdict, between [contaminated] leprosy and [uncontaminated] leprosy, [in essence] matters under dispute in your city, you should rise up and ascend to the place that Hashem, your G-d has chosen for you."},{"verse":"9","text":"And you should come to the Kohanim, to the Leviim, and to the [head] judge that will be in your days and you should inquire [about the matter], and they will tell you the ruling."},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""}]},{"chapter":"18","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"ve