n aquí."},{"verse":"15","text":"Ya que ustedes saben como vivimos en la tierra de Egipto, y como pasamos por las naciones donde pasaron."},{"verse":"16","text":"Donde vieron sus abominaciones y sus ídolos de palo y piedra, y los de plata y oro, cuales ellos poseían."},{"verse":"17","text":"Puede ser que hubiera un hombre o una mujer, o una tribu o familia entre ustedes cual su corazón se aleje hoy de nuestro Dios Adonai, para ir a servir a los dioses de esas naciones. No sea que haya entre ustedes una raíz que produzca hierba amarga y hiel."},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""}]},{"chapter":"30","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""}]},{"chapter":"31","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""},{"verse":"29","text":""},{"verse":"30","text":""}]},{"chapter":"32","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":"Give ear, O heavens, let me speak; Let the earth hear the words I utter!"},{"verse":"2","text":"...May my discourse come down as the rain, My speech distill as the dew, Like showers on young growth, Like droplets on the grass."},{"verse":"3","text":"...For the name of the Eternal I proclaim; Give glory to our God!"},{"verse":"4","text":"...The Rock! - whoes deeds are perfect, Yea, all God's way are just;"},{"verse":"5","text":"...Unworthy children -that crooked, perverse generation - Their baseness has played God false."},{"verse":"6","text":"...Do you thus requite Eternal, O dull and witless people? Is not this the Father who created you -Fashioned you and made you endure!"},{"verse":"7","text":"...Remember the days of old, consider the years of ages passed; Ask your parent, who will inform you, Your elders, who will tell you:"},{"verse":"8","text":"...When the Most High gave nations their homes and set the divisions of humanity, [God] fixed the boundaries of peoples In relation to Israel's numbers."},{"verse":"9","text":"...For the Eternal's portion is this people; Jacob, God's own allotment."},{"verse":"10","text":"...[God] found them in a desert region, in an empty housing waste. [God] engirded them, watched over them, Guarded them as the pupil of God's eye"},{"verse":"11","text":"...Like an eagle who rouses it's nestlings, Gliding down to is young, So did [God] spread wings and take them, Bear along on pinions;"},{"verse":"12","text":"The Eternal alone did guide them, No alien god alongside."},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""},{"verse":"29","text":""},{"verse":"30","text":""},{"verse":"31","text":""},{"verse":"32","text":""},{"verse":"33","text":""},{"verse":"34","text":""},{"verse":"35","text":""},{"verse":"36","text":""},{"verse":"37","text":""},{"verse":"38","text":""},{"verse":"39","text":""},{"verse":"40","text":""},{"verse":"41","text":""},{"verse":"42","text":""},{"verse":"43","text":""},{"verse":"44","text":""},{"verse":"45","text":""},{"verse":"46","text":""},{"verse":"47","text":""},{"verse":"48","text":""},{"verse":"49","text":""},{"verse":"50","text":""},{"verse":"51","text":""},{"verse":"52","text":""}]},{"chapter":"33","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""},{"verse":"29","text":""}]},{"chapter":"34","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""}]}]}
